OL,3,GNEWSASuella Braverman slap joke
OL,4,A'disgraceful', says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FSuella Braverman says a joke a comedian
OL,7,Fmade about slapping her was
OL,8,F"disgraceful", following the murder of
OL,9,FAnne Widdecombe.
OL,11,FDame Meera Syal, known for her roles in
OL,12,FGoodness Gracious Me and The Kumars at
OL,13,FNo. 42, appeared at Cheltenham
OL,14,FLiterature Festival on Sunday, and
OL,15,Fdiscussed comments Braverman made on
OL,16,FQuestion Time.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
