OL,3,GNEWSASuella Braverman slap joke
OL,4,A'disgraceful', says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Reform UK MP for Fareham and
OL,7,FWaterlooville said on the show on 1
OL,8,FOctober: "I'm not an English person; I
OL,9,Fam of Asian origin.... Why are the
OL,10,FEnglish the only group of people on the
OL,11,Fearth who cannot have a distinct
OL,12,Fidentity?"
OL,14,FAt the festival, Dame Meera said she
OL,15,Fwould be interested to know what
OL,16,Fhappened to Braverman during childhood,
OL,17,Fclaiming she "either needs a hug or a
OL,18,Fslap".
